  "notes": "Anime Dice is an idle collecting game from More & More Games. You roll dice to reveal anime characters inspired by shows like Naruto and Dragon Ball, then place the best ones on your team to earn money, which keeps coming in while you are offline. Upgrading your dice raises your luck, so rarer characters and mutations turn up more often, and a stronger team moves you up the leaderboards.\n\nCodes here give Lucky Spins, Trait Rerolls, Tickets and Gems. Lucky Spins are the most useful early on because each one has a better shot at a rare character, while Trait Rerolls pay off more once you have a character worth keeping. New codes come out with each numbered update and whenever the game reaches a like goal or a player count goal.",
